OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy this evening with a few
OL,7,Fclear spells in places, though cloud
OL,8,Fincreasing overnight. Largely dry
OL,9,Fthrough the evening, but showers
OL,10,Fdeveloping through the early hours.
OL,11,FChilly with a grass frost possible in
OL,12,Fplaces.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FLargely cloudy with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain or showers moving
OL,16,Fnorth through the day. A strengthening
OL,17,Feasterly breeze, though temperatures
OL,18,Faround normal for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
