OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,7,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,8,Frain or showers, and a gentle breeze.
OL,9,FTemperatures remain around normal for
OL,10,Fthe time of year.
